    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it’s not just some feeling, though. i see it in the way we all act, the way we all break. it feels more like a biological certainty than just \"mental health.\" like, if the blueprint is already flawed, why bother trying to build something that's just gonna collapse anyway? it feels like i'm just fighting a war that's already been lost.",
