    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean, i hear what you're saying, but it just feels so exhausting to keep \"rejecting\" something that's literally part of my cells. it's like trying to argue with gravity. if the end result is always the same for people like me, isn't there a certain kind of peace in just accepting it? instead of fighting a losing battle for years, maybe it's just... more logical to stop fighting.",
