      "content": "While it is natural to seek the peace that comes from acceptance, please know that deciding to stop living because of a family history does not have to be your solution. Many people with similar backgrounds find profound meaning and purpose by choosing their own narrative, even when it is difficult right now. You are not obligated to fight a battle that is not yours to win, but you also hold the power to define your own future on your own terms, separate from your lineage. If the exhaustion is truly unbearable, talking to a therapist can help you find a way through this heaviness that allows you to live meaningfully, even if you aren't sure what that looks like yet.",
